$ env PATH=<S>/bin:<PATH> sh tracker-read.sh --url https://github.com/cli/cli/issues/1
    tracker-read.sh: gh issue view failed (timed out after 30 s); expected the issue; try checking gh is logged in for github.com and the issue is visible to you
